              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_2_table_10.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tr><td>S.No.</td><td>Material</td><td>Good or Poor conductor of heat</td></tr><tr><td></td><td>Steel</td><td>Good conductor</td></tr><tr><td>2.</td><td>Wood</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>3.</td><td></td><td></td></tr></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.85,
            0.742,
            0.889
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Does your list include air? If it is there on the list, where have you placed it?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.889,
            0.743,
            0.929
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You must have experienced that during winters, we prefer wearing woollen clothes to keep ourselves warm."
            }
          ]
        },
